(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-68","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["值守员的[[plea|请求]]不是宽恕站长，而是先把名字读对。他不靠[[persuasion|劝说]]改变表，先替避险点查[[nutrition|营养]]物资。小孩围着桌子[[jog|慢跑]]，我们要[[ascertain|查明]]封套来自哪一次装柜，仍须[[strive|努力]]对齐照片。岛站[[database|数据库]]只剩最新用途，原页却应当[[intelligible|可以理解]]。馆员一眼看出一张[[imitation|仿制品]]，站长还要以[[compliment|恭维]]换她称许。她说印得像不是旧纸，自己的工作是分辨，不是讨谁喜欢。我们把真伪页都编号，没有因为一张假页就丢掉它暴露的制作经过。","广播员承认昨天有一次[[blunder|失误]]，未报告通讯[[breach|中断]]。他愿意[[comply|遵从]]补记要求，但记录曾[[deviate|偏离]]实货，不能用新表盖旧表。奖金是替换的[[stimulus|刺激]]，多用途名却[[bewilder|使人迷惑]]。基金像[[regiment|严密编组]]一样管理志愿者，报损数会[[diminish|减少]]，出货则[[surpass|超过]]观测需求。馆里的[[affiliate|附属机构]]本无能力作实验核验，其印章却在临床援助表上。这一处说明问题发生在交接授权，而不是一个孩子说漏了什么。杜医生电话确认自己也从未看过馆里的授权范围。","真正的原表慢慢[[unfold|展开]]。夹层[[wedge|楔片]]不是密码，只防柜门滑到[[brink|边缘]]。所谓[[perpetual|永久的]]封存，在[[retrospect|回顾]]里只有三天。[[humidity|湿度]]数字旁是[[preparatory|预备的]]移交，主管却把编号[[carve|刻印]]到援助牌上。[[veil|掩盖]]变化的方法简单得令人发冷：删除真实保存用途，再加一个新名称。这样的转运可能[[hazardous|危险]]，具体风险要由检验确定。我们不敢让标签里的可怕字眼替代实物，不然只要换一套悦耳字眼，下一次又会被同样办法骗过。","岛上[[locality|地区]]要继续生活，调查[[proceeding|程序]]也不能使我们[[underestimate|低估]]人的处境。一名[[transient|临住的]]志愿者的大学[[dean|院长]]联络安排接续。她用[[sponge|海绵]]擦掉避险点桌水，不愿照片公开，因为曾在另一份援助登记中报告[[rape|强奸]]后受过骚扰。程雾尊重她拒绝实名，不录她的[[nickname|绰号]]。她只协助核饭盒领取日，旧表有关动物[[metabolic|代谢的]]观察与任何个人病史都分开。她在桌边写下日期，手停了一会，接着替另一个人把椅子扶稳，没人催她提供更多故事。","地上[[litter|杂乱废物]]由两人[[alternate|轮流]]清理。馆员看旧研究者[[biography|传记]]，对基金无损坏声明很[[skeptical|怀疑]]；原页标明[[ultraviolet|紫外的]]设备需另存，捐赠人[[visa|签证]]记录则证明他当时不在岛上。不能让他替附近[[vicinity|周围地区]]每次交货作证。我曾经很[[naive|轻信]]有外国落款就可靠，现在先问哪个日子[[precede|先于]]哪个日子。老陈上坡回来还在[[gasp|喘气]]，程雾叫他别装成只是[[stroll|散步]]。他交出高岸的轮痕照，说明移柜路早已改变，站长的旧路线不能原样再走。","实际页列出B-17先作实验存货，报损后再改作旧馆藏，最后改成援助器件。我们按每种用途找到接收签字，只有最后一栏用‘基金统一调度’替掉具体姓名。旁附付款传真来自贺青办公室；这说明办公室下过改签指令，不等于贺青已亲手看过每只破箱。原表由执勤员封存，我们获得获准的核验影像。程雾将手包好，听广播员补报告收发时间。明天要找调度签字所指的海岸泊位，把纸页写的三次改名与真的出航接上。我们今晚有床可睡，守封套的人也终于能换班。"],"en":["The keeper's [[plea|plea]] was to read names correctly, not pardon the director. Without [[persuasion|persuasion]] altering papers he checked [[nutrition|nutrition]] supplies. Children would [[jog|jog]] around tables while we sought to [[ascertain|ascertain]] custody and [[strive|strive]] for photographic alignment. The [[database|database]] retained latest uses; originals needed to be [[intelligible|intelligible]]. The curator identified an [[imitation|imitation]] and rejected the director's [[compliment|compliment]]. Accuracy was her job. We numbered genuine and false pages alike, preserving what fabrication revealed about its production.","The broadcaster admitted a [[blunder|blunder]]: failing to report a communication [[breach|breach]]. He would [[comply|comply]] with supplementation, yet cargo had begun to [[deviate|deviate]] from forms. Bonuses supplied a [[stimulus|stimulus]]; multiple names could [[bewilder|bewilder]]. Attempts to [[regiment|regiment]] volunteers made losses [[diminish|diminish]] while departures would [[surpass|surpass]] research demand. A museum [[affiliate|affiliate]] lacked experimental verification authority, despite its stamp on aid forms. Authorization, not a child's account, was at issue. Du confirmed he had never checked that scope either.","Originals began to [[unfold|unfold]]. An inner [[wedge|wedge]] prevented the door reaching the [[brink|brink]], concealing no code. [[perpetual|Perpetual]] storage lasted three days in [[retrospect|retrospect]]. Beside [[humidity|humidity]] readings lay [[preparatory|preparatory]] transfers; management would [[carve|carve]] numbers onto aid boards. To [[veil|veil]] changes, it deleted true storage uses and added names. Transfer might be [[hazardous|hazardous]]; specialists would establish risks. Frightening label words were no substitute for objects, or pleasant replacements would deceive us once again.","This [[locality|locality]] needed life alongside investigative [[proceeding|proceeding]]. We must not [[underestimate|underestimate]] hardship. A [[transient|transient]] volunteer's [[dean|dean]] arranged continuing support. Wiping water with a [[sponge|sponge]], she declined publicity after harassment following a previous [[rape|rape]] report. Cheng respected anonymity and withheld her [[nickname|nickname]]. She helped check container dates. Animal [[metabolic|metabolic]] observations remained separate from private histories. Pausing after her date, she steadied another person's chair. Nobody urged her to give us a more dramatic story.","Two people would [[alternate|alternate]] clearing [[litter|litter]]. Reading a scientist's [[biography|biography]], the curator remained [[skeptical|skeptical]] of no-damage claims. [[ultraviolet|Ultraviolet]] equipment needed separate storage. A donor's [[visa|visa]] proved absence from the island, not testimony about every delivery in its [[vicinity|vicinity]]. Once [[naive|naive]] about foreign signatures, I now asked which dates [[precede|precede]] others. Returning uphill with a [[gasp|gasp]], Chen pretended it was a [[stroll|stroll]]. Cheng made him sit. His wheel-track photographs showed a changed cabinet route, invalidating the director's old map.","B-17 moved from experimental stock through damaged museum goods to aid equipment. We identified recipients at each stage; 'central fund dispatch' replaced a name only at the last. An attached fax came from He Qing's office, proving an office instruction, not his personal examination of each box. Officers sealed originals and authorized verification images. Tomorrow we would connect three renamings to actual departures at the shore berth. Tonight beds were available, and those guarding the envelope could finally change shifts."]});
